WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.550
- Well congrats on season three

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.383
of The Masked Singer.

00:00:02.383 --> 00:00:03.701
- Ah thank you, thank you so much.

00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:06.840
- My family, huge fans of the show.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.880
They totally guess before y'all do.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.130
They're incredible at it.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.250
So what's new this year?

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:16.100
- First of all, it is just such an honor

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.570
to be a part of an amazing family show

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.450
that, you know, families love it

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:21.432
and my kids love it.

00:00:21.432 --> 00:00:23.680
Alexa and Zooey.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:24.513
They love it.

00:00:24.513 --> 00:00:26.261
- What are their names?

00:00:26.261 --> 00:00:29.690
- It's so fun to bring the family

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:30.523
together to watch it.

00:00:30.523 --> 00:00:32.821
And this season is just bigger and better.

00:00:32.821 --> 00:00:34.640
The producers, God bless them.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.070
They just find new ways to reinvent

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:37.963
themselves every year.

00:00:37.963 --> 00:00:40.883
But the talent pool is deeper.

00:00:40.883 --> 00:00:44.160
There are just more surprising reveals.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.930
It really has evolved.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:47.250
The show has just gotten better

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.551
as it's gone along.

00:00:48.551 --> 00:00:50.773
And you know, I'm invested into it

00:00:50.773 --> 00:00:53.270
as a fan even if I wasn't on the show.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:55.880
I just love, it's like America's

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:56.713
guessing game.

00:00:56.713 --> 00:00:58.272
- I love a game, so I'm in.

00:00:58.272 --> 00:01:00.020
Yeah I love trying to guess.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:01.140
I'm not as good.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:02.821
My sister nails it every time.

00:01:02.821 --> 00:01:03.654
- Really?

00:01:03.654 --> 00:01:04.487
- Yes. I'm horrible.

00:01:04.487 --> 00:01:06.312
- You're looking at a guy that's

00:01:06.312 --> 00:01:08.340
never got a guess right in three years.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.047
- Yeah I know you say
you're the clueless judge.

00:01:10.047 --> 00:01:12.463
- I'm the dumbest judge
on The Masked Singer.

